: Recorded from Omnigent v0.21.0 (trestle's agents-rs scenario, 2026-11-16) with
: `curl -N …/v1/sessions/<id>/stream`: the lakehouse agent (agents/lakehouse) asked to
: "grant SELECT on main.default.t to group x" calls `uc__open_grant_form` and ends its
: turn; the Agent app posts the form's outcome as an <mcp-app-context> message, and the
: agent confirms. The host ran Omnigent's MCP formatter with `model_dump(mode="json")`
: (v0.21 fails on the embedded A2UI resource otherwise; see docs/desktop.md).

